Wishing SPOILERS ahead:


The first thing to wish for is a blessed luckstone.  Once you have the luck-
stone, don't ever drop it, as it looses its blessing from being dropped.  Once
you have the stone you should find a unicorn and throw gems at it.  Ten
unidentified stones will give you +10 luck, which is the max you can get with
unidentified stones.  There is a way to get 3 more points (total of 13) of
luck, but I forgot how it is done.

The blessed luckstone keeps your luck up at the high levels without timing
out.  This means that your chances of actually getting the next items you wish
for are greatly increased.

